==Strategy==
Use this stage to learn about the sheer power of EVA Unit-13. Although boasting low stats here, this boss is incredibly dangerous and will wipe out any players that aren't properly prepared against it. Like all bosses from the Evangelion collab, it is immune to all cat cannon effects except for curse, which can be used to some extent to disable the slow, however shouldn't be relied on. Speaking of the slow, since EVA-13's attack is split into 3 different strikes, your units will usually only suffer a third of the attack before getting knocked back and slowed, meaning you don't have to worry about your units dying every time he attacks.

For the stage itself, a spam of meatshields and midrangers with medium-high knockback counts is recommended, with peon clearers to take out the periodic peons.

